{"text": "风险管控", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "", "chunk_id": "H_59aa9bdaa42eaec4f1579d26", "source_id": "03692_9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 13, "section": ""}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n\n[Content]\n风险管控", "prev_chunk_id": "H_c08821a348530964eb7cd854", "next_chunk_id": "H_8dd6521f59a97699c79d6d15", "parser_source_id": "9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "company_id": "03692", "source_level": 3, "source_kind": "announcement", "report_year": null, "metadata_status": "registered", "evidence_issues": ["source_kind_requires_content_classification", "2025_effectiveness_requires_evidence"]}
{"text": "为有效控制风险，翰森制药在风险评估和监管方面建立了完善的标准化流程，从识别风险、评估风险、制定缓释措施及监督改进等全流程、跨部门协同管理风险。在政策倡导方面，通过多项制度编制、设计和系统化搭建，实现研发、生产、商业推广等领域全覆盖。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "", "chunk_id": "H_8dd6521f59a97699c79d6d15", "source_id": "03692_9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 14, "section": ""}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n\n[Content]\n为有效控制风险，翰森制药在风险评估和监管方面建立了完善的标准化流程，从识别风险、评估风险、制定缓释措施及监督改进等全流程、跨部门协同管理风险。在政策倡导方面，通过多项制度编制、设计和系统化搭建，实现研发、生产、商业推广等领域全覆盖。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_59aa9bdaa42eaec4f1579d26", "next_chunk_id": "H_85b5d1cb627916e76354a90a", "parser_source_id": "9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "company_id": "03692", "source_level": 3, "source_kind": "announcement", "report_year": null, "metadata_status": "registered", "evidence_issues": ["source_kind_requires_content_classification", "2025_effectiveness_requires_evidence"]}
{"text": "我们组建了一支知合规、懂业务、守底线的合规队伍，建立了行业领先的合规体系，持续提醒和警示合规底线，不断提升全员合规管理责任意识。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "", "chunk_id": "H_85b5d1cb627916e76354a90a", "source_id": "03692_9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 15, "section": ""}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n\n[Content]\n我们组建了一支知合规、懂业务、守底线的合规队伍，建立了行业领先的合规体系，持续提醒和警示合规底线，不断提升全员合规管理责任意识。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_8dd6521f59a97699c79d6d15", "next_chunk_id": "H_21f8c16588b896b95af1b39f", "parser_source_id": "9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "company_id": "03692", "source_level": 3, "source_kind": "announcement", "report_year": null, "metadata_status": "registered", "evidence_issues": ["source_kind_requires_content_classification", "2025_effectiveness_requires_evidence"]}
{"text": "监督与改进", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "", "chunk_id": "H_21f8c16588b896b95af1b39f", "source_id": "03692_9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 16, "section": ""}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n\n[Content]\n监督与改进", "prev_chunk_id": "H_85b5d1cb627916e76354a90a", "next_chunk_id": "H_1b2232673db9b977f5e1d162", "parser_source_id": "9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "company_id": "03692", "source_level": 3, "source_kind": "announcement", "report_year": null, "metadata_status": "registered", "evidence_issues": ["source_kind_requires_content_classification", "2025_effectiveness_requires_evidence"]}
{"text": "我们构建三维立体监管体系，预防风险、控制风险，确保管理要求落地；强化过程管控，增加AI智能技术和第三方监督双重机制确保对各项环节有效监督；专业的合规团队能及时发现和纠正违规行为，防范潜在法律风险，保障企业稳健发展。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "", "chunk_id": "H_1b2232673db9b977f5e1d162", "source_id": "03692_9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 17, "section": ""}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n\n[Content]\n我们构建三维立体监管体系，预防风险、控制风险，确保管理要求落地；强化过程管控，增加AI智能技术和第三方监督双重机制确保对各项环节有效监督；专业的合规团队能及时发现和纠正违规行为，防范潜在法律风险，保障企业稳健发展。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_21f8c16588b896b95af1b39f", "next_chunk_id": "H_83e8c5159afcb43a8e03496b", "parser_source_id": "9740041f8fcf7aa455de7b40ce4417816222879d51d25d5b7606107e80583f45", "company_id": "03692", "source_level": 3, "source_kind": "announcement", "report_year": null, "metadata_status": "registered", "evidence_issues": ["source_kind_requires_content_classification", "2025_effectiveness_requires_evidence"]}
